=== Text #1 ===
> The[ Davidson Playhouse] is a perfectly located sanctuary for parents, grandparents, caregivers and[ their] children. Our focus is sensory play in a safe, clean environment. We offer several levels of members[hips], a diverse variety of classes, story time, and even summer[ camps]! We cater to all children[ through] age 7. There is always something exciting going on at[ The] Davidson Play[house] and we want you to join in on the fun! If you're interested in becoming a member[,] please contact us today!
Anyone can come[ and] play! You do not have to be a member to bring your little ones to the[ Playhouse].
We are open[ M]-F from 9[am]-1pm for everyone to come[ and] play[.]
The cost is[ $]8/[child] per[ open] play[ session.]
[Follow us] on Facebook and Instagram for[ event and] class[ announcements]![]

